  "bodyHtml": "\n\n\t\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-byline\">\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-author\"><a href=\"/archive/source-168842638426899e3410/\" rel=\"author\" class=\"url fn n\"><span>Michael Rudden</span></a></span>\n\t\t\t\t<time class=\"entry-published updated\" datetime=\"2026-07-01T16:06:25-04:00\" title=\"Wednesday, July 1, 2026, 4:06 pm\">July 1, 2026</time>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"comments-link\"></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-content\">\n\t\t\t<p>The Guild of Harwich Artists are now displaying our original fine art paintings in the front yard of the Pilgrim Congregational Church on Wednesdays from 10am-3:30pm.  The church is located at 533 Main Street (RT 28) in Harwich Port.  Parking is available at the Harwich Port Visitor Center parking lot. <img class=\"aligncenter size-medium wp-image-7438\" src=\"/media/archive/18677bdefeecd9d70ff71b27b7ba042db9b225cc837520b814d7d5feb878d214.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"225\" loading=\"lazy\" /> <img class=\"aligncenter size-medium wp-image-7440\" src=\"/media/archive/1bb901005b3f360cc4593432234474732c140b85d11e1536f1f912c679788abf.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"267\" loading=\"lazy\" /> <img class=\"aligncenter size-medium wp-image-7441\" src=\"/media/archive/18677bdefeecd9d70ff71b27b7ba042db9b225cc837520b814d7d5feb878d214.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"225\" loading=\"lazy\" /> <img loading=\"lazy\" class=\"aligncenter size-medium wp-image-7442\" src=\"/media/archive/a47023c9665394d820f15abb10c3be96d468ddda925ef4f5a2ca874d2823eead.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"239\" /> <img loading=\"lazy\" class=\"aligncenter size-medium wp-image-7443\" src=\"/media/archive/23b55671fd563e0842383dc87812695eefd031ab69db959ab03004f602cda4aa.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"196\" /></p>\n\n\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t<footer class=\"entry-footer\">\n\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-terms category\">Posted in <a href=\"/archive/source-e23b79be08a822c7b682/\" rel=\"tag\">WHAT'S NEW</a></span>\t\t\t\t\t</footer>\n\n\t\n",
